  ('LCS-RE12-S', 'Rotary Evaporator (Electric Lift) LCS-RE12-S', 'lachoi-rotary-evaporator-electric-lift-lcs-re12-s', 'RE series rotary evaporator is a high-efficiency separation device using reduced-pressure distillation. It rotates the flask to form a liquid film for rapid solvent evaporation under low-temperature vacuum, with condensation for recovery. Ideal for heat-sensitive materials in chemical, biological and pharmaceutical applications.', '[["Model", "LCS-RE12-S"], ["Speed Range (rpm)", "20~280"], ["Power Supply", "AC220V/50Hz"], ["Display Mode", "LCD"], ["Bidirectional Rotation Speed (rpm)", "20~200"], ["Output Power (W)", "100"], ["Vacuum Degree (MPa)", "0.095"], ["Lifting Method", "Electric lifting"], ["Condenser", "Double spiral condenser"], ["Rotating Flask", "29#, 1 L"], ["Receiving Flask", "35#, 1 L"], ["Feeding Valve", "19#"], ["Lifting Distance (mm)", "10~150"], ["Bidirectional Rotation", "Yes"], ["Main Machine Dimensions (mm)", "543×450×830"], ["Main Machine Net Weight (kg)", "19"], ["Heating Bath Volume (L)", "3"], ["Heating Bath Power (W)", "800"], ["Heating Bath Temp. Range (°C)", "Water bath RT~90; oil bath RT~200"], ["Heating Bath Temp. Accuracy (°C)", "0.1"], ["Heating Bath Timing Range", "99h59min"], ["Heating Method", "Electric heating tube"], ["Heating Bath Material", "SUS304 + Teflon coating"], ["Inner Container Size (φ×H, mm)", "236×204"], ["Heating Bath Dimensions (mm)", "317×295×335"], ["Heating Bath Net Weight (kg)", "4"]]', '["LCD touch screen, 20~280 rpm stepless speed adjustment, reversible rotation to prevent wall adhesion", "Over-temperature protection and auto power-off; flask automatically lifts 150 mm from the heat source in case of abnormality", "Stainless steel Teflon-coated bath with PID control, high borosilicate glass", "Vertical double spiral condenser with 1700 cm² area, continuous feeding system", "Quick-release flask mechanism, touch-controlled lifting, anti-scald design"]', 'equipment', '/products/lachoi/re-s.jpg'),
