  ('LCS-DB-100H', 'Dry Bath LCS-DB-100H', 'lachoi-dry-bath-lcs-db-100h', 'DB series dry baths are constant temperature devices that replace traditional water baths for precise small-volume experiments. Used for enzyme reactions, PCR, protein denaturation and sample storage in life science, biomedical and chemical applications.', '[["Model", "LCS-DB-100H"], ["Power Supply", "AC220V/50Hz"], ["Power (W)", "560"], ["Optional Modules", "96×0.2 mL / 54×0.5 mL / 35×1.5 mL / 35×2.0 mL / 24×5.0 mL / 12×15 mL / 6×50 mL"], ["Display Mode", "LCD"], ["Display Content", "Multi-point mode, temperature, time"], ["Temp. Control Range (°C)", "RT+5~100"], ["Temp. Accuracy (°C)", "±0.5"], ["Heating Method", "PTC ceramic"], ["Cooling Method", "Natural cooling + fan"], ["Timing Range", "1 min~99h59min"], ["Programming", "Multi-segment (1~10 segments)"], ["Net Weight (kg)", "4.2"], ["Product Dimensions (mm)", "271×205×141"]]', '["LCD shows set and real-time data simultaneously", "Magnesium-aluminum alloy module for precise, rapid temperature control", "Semiconductor heating/cooling (LCS-DB-100HC)", "Multi-layer heat dissipation and over-temperature protection", "Self-diagnosis and audible alarm for faults", "10 programmable segments, up to 99 cycles", "Dual overheating protection (software + physical power cutoff)", "Residual heat warning to prevent burns", "Temperature calibration and power-off memory"]', 'life-science', '/products/lachoi/db.jpg'),
